{"title": "Githyanki War Magic", "pageid": 17549, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Githyanki_War_Magic", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the Eldritch Knight Fighter passive, see <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/War_Magic\" title=\"War Magic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/War_Magic_Icon.webp/25px-War_Magic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/War_Magic_Icon.webp/38px-War_Magic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/War_Magic_Icon.webp/50px-War_Magic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"War Magic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/War_Magic_Icon.webp/25px-War_Magic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1a/War_Magic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/War_Magic\" title=\"War Magic\">War Magic</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:War_Magic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/War_Magic.webp/300px-War_Magic.webp, /w/images/b/b9/War_Magic.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/War_Magic.webp/300px-War_Magic.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/War_Magic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Githyanki War Magic</b> is a passive feature that allows a <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">githyanki</a> to make a follow up weapon attack after casting a spell or cantrip.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>After the githyanki casts a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">spell or cantrip</a>, they can make a weapon attack using a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Githyanki_War_Magic\"> Condition: Githyanki War Magic </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_War_Magic_(Condition)\" title=\"Githyanki War Magic (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Githyanki_War_Magic_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Githyanki_War_Magic_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Githyanki_War_Magic_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Githyanki_War_Magic_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Githyanki_War_Magic_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Githyanki_War_Magic_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Githyanki War Magic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Githyanki_War_Magic_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Githyanki_War_Magic_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Githyanki_War_Magic_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_War_Magic_(Condition)\" title=\"Githyanki War Magic (Condition)\">Githyanki War Magic</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Can make a weapon attack using a bonus action.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Far%27aag\" title=\"Far'aag\">Far'aag</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/For%27reth\" title=\"For'reth\">For'reth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ghush%27ins\" title=\"Ghush'ins\">Ghush'ins</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jeera\" title=\"Jeera\">Jeera</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ko%27kuu\" title=\"Ko'kuu\">Ko'kuu</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Therezzyn\" title=\"Therezzyn\">Therezzyn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tska%27an\" title=\"Tska'an\">Tska'an</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Umr%27a%27ac\" title=\"Umr'a'ac\">Umr'a'ac</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Yy%27rul\" title=\"Yy'rul\">Yy'rul</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zhendila\" title=\"Zhendila\">Zhendila</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This feature is only available to Githyanki <a href=\"/wiki/NPC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"NPC\">NPCs</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">After casing a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">spell or cantrip</a>, can make a <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus action\">bonus</a> weapon attack.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714235054\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nC